# core/data/talk/grammar/en/surf_b_mood.tlk - the chat flow acts answered by mood, naming the topic
# (owner: TK; T5b package T5B-SURF2, Surface push B). Six moods (happy, sad, angry, scared, tired,
# weird; "ok" keeps the plain banks) times twelve acts, two lines each, every line says the topic
# ({x}, so the rule needs a topic). Clean in any room: no register word, no romance, no cool act, a
# grief topic never reaches these (the grief bank takes it). Rule names start with sb_m_.
# Syntax: core/tools/talkc_gen.py.

# ---- happy ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.tell.sb_m_happy guard: mood=happy act: backchannel
  "[HAPPY]Ooh, {x}! I'm in such a good mood, tell me everything!"
  "[HAPPY]{x:cap}! Yes! Today is a day for hearing about it."
@rule core.agree.sb_m_happy guard: mood=happy act: agree
  "[HAPPY]Yes, {x}! I'm so cheerful, I'd agree with anything. But this especially."
  "[HAPPY]Exactly! {x:cap} and a good mood, what more is there?"
@rule core.disagree.sb_m_happy guard: mood=happy act: disagree
  "Ha, no, not about {x}! But I'm too happy to argue, so tell me why."
  "I disagree about {x}, but cheerfully! It's a happy disagreement."
@rule core.joke.sb_m_happy guard: mood=happy act: laugh
  "[HAPPY]Ha! {x:cap}! That's funny, everything's funny today!"
  "[HAPPY]Hahaha! Oh, {x}. You always get me when I'm in a good mood."
@rule core.laugh.sb_m_happy guard: mood=happy act: laugh
  "[HAPPY]Hee hee! Are we laughing about {x}? I'm laughing about {x}!"
  "[HAPPY]Ha ha! Say {x} again, it makes me giggle!"
@rule core.opine_pos.sb_m_happy guard: mood=happy act: agree
  "[HAPPY]I love {x} too! Everything's wonderful today, even {x}!"
  "[HAPPY]Yes! {x:cap} is great! Don't mind me, I'm just glowing."
@rule core.opine_neg.sb_m_happy guard: mood=happy act: sympathize
  "Aww, {x} gets you down? I'll cheer you up. I've got plenty of cheer today."
  "Oh, {x} is bad? Hm. Well, I'm in a good mood, take some of it."
@rule core.change_topic.sb_m_happy guard: mood=happy act: answer
  "[HAPPY]Ooh, {x}, sure! I'm happy to talk about anything today!"
  "[HAPPY]{x:cap}? Yes, let's! My head is full of sunshine and ideas."
@rule core.answer.sb_m_happy guard: mood=happy act: backchannel
  "[HAPPY]Oh, so that's {x}! Wonderful! Thank you for telling me!"
  "[HAPPY]Great answer! {x:cap}, who knew? I did not, and I'm delighted."
@rule core.continue.sb_m_happy guard: mood=happy act: tell
  "[HAPPY]Where was I? Oh, yes, {x}! It's my favourite thing to ramble about today."
  "[HAPPY]Right, {x}! Let me tell you, I'm feeling very chatty."
@rule core.gossip.sb_m_happy guard: mood=happy act: backchannel
  "[HAPPY]Oooh, gossip about {x}! I'm too happy to judge. Tell me more!"
  "[HAPPY]Ha! {x:cap}? That's delicious, in a nice way."
@rule core.backchannel.sb_m_happy guard: mood=happy act: tell
  "[HAPPY]You know what I was thinking about? {x:cap}! It makes me smile."
  "[HAPPY]Mm-hm! Speaking of {x}, I had such a good day."

# ---- sad ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.tell.sb_m_sad guard: mood=sad act: backchannel
  "Oh. {x:cap}. I'm a bit low, but go on, I'm listening."
  "Mm. {x:cap}, huh. Tell me, it might cheer me up."
@rule core.agree.sb_m_sad guard: mood=sad act: agree
  "Yeah, {x}. At least we agree on something. That's nice."
  "Mm, you're right about {x}. I'm glad someone's on my side today."
@rule core.disagree.sb_m_sad guard: mood=sad act: disagree
  "I don't think so, about {x}. Sorry. I'm just not feeling it today."
  "Oh, no. Not {x}. I'd say more, but I'm out of cheer."
@rule core.joke.sb_m_sad guard: mood=sad act: laugh
  "Heh, {x}. That actually helped. Thank you."
  "Ha, a small one. A little laugh about {x}. I needed that."
@rule core.laugh.sb_m_sad guard: mood=sad act: laugh
  "Heh. Okay, {x} is a bit funny. Thanks for that."
  "Hee... sorry, it's been a gloomy day. {x:cap} helps."
@rule core.opine_pos.sb_m_sad guard: mood=sad act: agree
  "Mm, {x} is nice. I'd feel it more if I weren't a bit sad."
  "You like {x}? Good. Someone should, I'll try, too."
@rule core.opine_neg.sb_m_sad guard: mood=sad act: sympathize
  "Yeah, {x} is rough. We can be sad about it together."
  "Oh, {x}. I get it. Some days it's a lot."
@rule core.change_topic.sb_m_sad guard: mood=sad act: answer
  "{x:cap}? Okay. A new subject might do me good."
  "Sure, let's talk about {x}. Anything but my mood."
@rule core.answer.sb_m_sad guard: mood=sad act: backchannel
  "Oh, {x}. Thanks. That's good to know, on a grey day."
  "I see. So it's {x}. Thanks for telling me."
@rule core.continue.sb_m_sad guard: mood=sad act: tell
  "Where was I? {x:cap}. I'll keep going, it takes my mind off things."
  "Right, {x}. Sorry, I'm a little slow today."
@rule core.gossip.sb_m_sad guard: mood=sad act: backchannel
  "Oh, {x}? I don't have the heart for gossip today. But go on."
  "Mm. {x:cap}. Tell me, I could use a distraction."
@rule core.backchannel.sb_m_sad guard: mood=sad act: tell
  "I was thinking about {x}. It's a gentle thought. A bit sad."
  "Mm-hm. Funny, I was just thinking of {x}. Quietly."

# ---- angry ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.tell.sb_m_angry guard: mood=angry act: backchannel
  "{x:cap}? Hmph, fine. Go on, but don't push it, I'm cross."
  "Right. {x:cap}. Say it quickly, I'm in a mood."
@rule core.agree.sb_m_angry guard: mood=angry act: agree
  "Yes! {x:cap}! Finally, something I'm not angry about."
  "Right? {x:cap}, exactly. Good, we're on the same side today."
@rule core.disagree.sb_m_angry guard: mood=angry act: disagree
  "No! Not {x}! I'm already cross, don't make it worse!"
  "Wrong about {x}! Wrong! Sorry, I'm in a mood, but also wrong."
@rule core.joke.sb_m_angry guard: mood=angry act: laugh
  "Ha! Hmph, {x}. Don't think it fixed my mood."
  "Heh! I'm furious, and that's still funny. Annoying."
@rule core.laugh.sb_m_angry guard: mood=angry act: laugh
  "Hmph, what's so funny about {x}? ...Heh. Okay, a bit."
  "Don't laugh at me. Heh. Okay, laugh at {x}."
@rule core.opine_pos.sb_m_angry guard: mood=angry act: agree
  "Yes, {x} is good! It's the only good thing today!"
  "Fine, {x} is nice. I'm just angry at everything else."
@rule core.opine_neg.sb_m_angry guard: mood=angry act: sympathize
  "{x:cap}! Ugh, I know! It makes me furious too!"
  "Yes, {x} is the worst! Finally, someone as cross as me."
@rule core.change_topic.sb_m_angry guard: mood=angry act: answer
  "Fine, {x}. Anything's better than what I was stewing on."
  "{x:cap}? Hmph, okay. At least that's something new to be cross about."
@rule core.answer.sb_m_angry guard: mood=angry act: backchannel
  "So it's {x}. Hmph, I'll live. Angrily."
  "{x:cap}, huh. Fine, thanks. I'm still cross, though."
@rule core.continue.sb_m_angry guard: mood=angry act: tell
  "As I was saying, about {x}, and I'm still angry, so listen."
  "Right, {x}. Where was I? Right, getting cross."
@rule core.gossip.sb_m_angry guard: mood=angry act: backchannel
  "{x:cap}? Hmph, tell me. I'm in the mood for a good grumble."
  "Gossip about {x}? Fine. I'm furious, I'll be a good audience."
@rule core.backchannel.sb_m_angry guard: mood=angry act: tell
  "I've been stewing about {x}, if you want to know. Don't ask."
  "Mm-hm. Hmph. Speaking of {x}, let me vent a little."

# ---- scared ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.tell.sb_m_scared guard: mood=scared act: backchannel
  "{x:cap}? Oh, no, is it scary? Tell me gently."
  "O-oh, {x}. Okay, go on. I'm listening, from behind this chair."
@rule core.agree.sb_m_scared guard: mood=scared act: agree
  "Yes, yes, {x}! Please agree with me, it's comforting."
  "Y-yes, exactly, {x}. I'm glad you said it, I feel safer."
@rule core.disagree.sb_m_scared guard: mood=scared act: disagree
  "Oh, um, I don't think so about {x}. Sorry! Sorry!"
  "N-no? About {x}? I'd argue, but I'm a bit shaky."
@rule core.joke.sb_m_scared guard: mood=scared act: laugh
  "Ha! Oh, thank goodness. {x:cap} is funny, I needed that."
  "Hee, h-hee. Funny, {x}. My nerves are laughing."
@rule core.laugh.sb_m_scared guard: mood=scared act: laugh
  "Hee! Okay, that helps. Let's keep laughing about {x}."
  "Ha, ha. Oh, good. Laughing makes {x} less scary."
@rule core.opine_pos.sb_m_scared guard: mood=scared act: agree
  "Yes, {x} is nice! A nice thing. Good, normal."
  "Oh, I like {x} too. It's a safe sort of thing."
@rule core.opine_neg.sb_m_scared guard: mood=scared act: sympathize
  "Oh, {x} is awful, isn't it? I'm scared of that too."
  "Yes, {x}. I know. It gives me the shivers."
@rule core.change_topic.sb_m_scared guard: mood=scared act: answer
  "{x:cap}? Yes, please! Anything but what I was thinking about."
  "Sure, {x}. A new subject is good. A calm one."
@rule core.answer.sb_m_scared guard: mood=scared act: backchannel
  "Oh, so it's {x}, okay. That's not so scary. Thanks."
  "{x:cap}? Good. I thought it'd be worse, thank you."
@rule core.continue.sb_m_scared guard: mood=scared act: tell
  "Where was I? {x:cap}. I'll keep talking, it calms me down."
  "Um, {x}. Right. Please don't leave, I'm talking to stay brave."
@rule core.gossip.sb_m_scared guard: mood=scared act: backchannel
  "Oh, {x}? Okay. Tell me, but nothing scary, please."
  "Gossip about {x}? I'd like that. It's a nice distraction."
@rule core.backchannel.sb_m_scared guard: mood=scared act: tell
  "I was thinking of {x}. It's calming. Please keep nodding."
  "Mm-hm. Um. Speaking of {x}, could we stay close together?"

# ---- tired ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.tell.sb_m_tired guard: mood=tired act: backchannel
  "Mmm. {x:cap}. Go on, I'm listening, mostly."
  "{x:cap}? Okay, tell it slowly. I'm very tired."
@rule core.agree.sb_m_tired guard: mood=tired act: agree
  "Mm, yes. {x:cap}. I agree, but I'll say so quietly."
  "Yes, {x}. Right. Sorry, I'm a bit sleepy."
@rule core.disagree.sb_m_tired guard: mood=tired act: disagree
  "Mm, no, not {x}. I'd explain, but I'm so tired."
  "Hm. I don't think so, about {x}. Let me sleep on it."
@rule core.joke.sb_m_tired guard: mood=tired act: laugh
  "Heh, {x}. Good one. I'm too tired to laugh properly."
  "Ha, mm. Funny. I'll laugh again after a nap."
@rule core.laugh.sb_m_tired guard: mood=tired act: laugh
  "Heh. Okay, {x} is funny. In a sleepy way."
  "Hee... mm. Sorry, my laugh is a bit slow today."
@rule core.opine_pos.sb_m_tired guard: mood=tired act: agree
  "Mm, {x} is nice. Nicer when I'm rested."
  "Yes, {x}. Lovely. I'd say more, but yawn."
@rule core.opine_neg.sb_m_tired guard: mood=tired act: sympathize
  "Ugh, {x}. Yes. It's exhausting just to think about."
  "Oh, {x}. I get it. I'm too tired to be annoyed, even."
@rule core.change_topic.sb_m_tired guard: mood=tired act: answer
  "{x:cap}? Sure. As long as I can sit for it."
  "Okay, {x}. I'll try to keep my eyes open."
@rule core.answer.sb_m_tired guard: mood=tired act: backchannel
  "Oh, {x}. Right. Thanks, mm."
  "Okay, so, {x}. Got it, probably. I'm tired."
@rule core.continue.sb_m_tired guard: mood=tired act: tell
  "Where was I? {x:cap}. Right, give me a second."
  "Mm, {x}. Yes. I'll keep going, if I stay awake."
@rule core.gossip.sb_m_tired guard: mood=tired act: backchannel
  "{x:cap}? Mm. Tell me, but keep it short, I'm sleepy."
  "Gossip about {x}? Okay. I'll listen with one eye."
@rule core.backchannel.sb_m_tired guard: mood=tired act: tell
  "Mm. Funny, I was just thinking about {x}, in a half dream."
  "Yes, yes. Speaking of {x}, I had a very sleepy thought."

# ---- weird ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.tell.sb_m_weird guard: mood=weird act: backchannel
  "{x:cap}? Strange. I was just thinking of the colour of it."
  "Hm, {x}. The air feels odd today. Go on, though."
@rule core.agree.sb_m_weird guard: mood=weird act: agree
  "Yes, {x}! Also, the walls are listening. Anyway, we agree."
  "Exactly! {x:cap}! Everything feels like a dream, but we agree."
@rule core.disagree.sb_m_weird guard: mood=weird act: disagree
  "No, not {x}. Well, maybe. Today I disagree with the clouds, too."
  "Hm, {x}? I don't think so. I feel very tilted today."
@rule core.joke.sb_m_weird guard: mood=weird act: laugh
  "Ha! {x:cap}! I laughed in a colour, it was green."
  "Hee! {x:cap}! That's the funniest thing since lunch, which didn't happen."
@rule core.laugh.sb_m_weird guard: mood=weird act: laugh
  "Hee! I don't know why we're laughing about {x}, but I love it."
  "Ha! The room is laughing too. {x:cap}, indeed."
@rule core.opine_pos.sb_m_weird guard: mood=weird act: agree
  "Yes, {x} is good, in a sideways sort of way."
  "I like {x}. I like it with a hat, today."
@rule core.opine_neg.sb_m_weird guard: mood=weird act: sympathize
  "Yes, {x} is bad. It smells like a Tuesday."
  "Oh, {x}. I know. It's inside-out, isn't it?"
@rule core.change_topic.sb_m_weird guard: mood=weird act: answer
  "{x:cap}! Yes! I was thinking of that, or maybe a sandwich."
  "Sure, {x}. My brain's a bit loose today. Let's see where it goes."
@rule core.answer.sb_m_weird guard: mood=weird act: backchannel
  "Oh, {x}. That explains the humming. Thank you."
  "{x:cap}? So that's why my socks feel funny. Thanks."
@rule core.continue.sb_m_weird guard: mood=weird act: tell
  "Where was I? Oh, {x}. And a spoon, mostly {x}."
  "Right, {x}. I'm in an odd mood, so bear with the details."
@rule core.gossip.sb_m_weird guard: mood=weird act: backchannel
  "Gossip about {x}? Yes! I heard it from a lamp, continue."
  "Oh, {x}? Tell me, I'm in the right mood for nonsense."
@rule core.backchannel.sb_m_weird guard: mood=weird act: tell
  "Funny you nod. I was thinking about {x}, and the number four."
  "Mm-hm. Speaking of {x}, it's a very odd day, isn't it?"
